          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iGibithe, noJuda, no-Edomi, nabantwana bakwa-Amoni, nabakwaMowabi, nabo bonke abasemagumbini ahlala ehlane; ngoba zonke lezi zizwe azisokile, futhi yonke indlu ka-Israyeli isokile enhliziyweni.",
